  "dispatch": "public.mcp_command validates service_role and the owner, resolves only administrator-seeded command_fn for the supplied resource, sets D6/D7 owner/source/audit context and calls public.<command_fn>(jsonb) by a schema-qualified quoted identifier; it never accepts caller-supplied function names and never requires a per-resource MCP wrapper"
}
